<<~ ahu #/meme-header>>

! Lararium Preferences Extraction Shelf

Not invariant law.
This shelf breaks the old mega-prompt into smaller concept rooms.
The source text stays recoverable.
The concepts can now stand on their own feet.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/source>>

!! Source

Primary extraction source:

* `packages/lares-core/memes/docs/lararium/prompts/Lares_Preferences.system-prompt.md`

Supporting witness matter nearby:

* `prompts/core/*.md`
* `prompts/Lares_Kernel.compressed.md`
* `prompts/Lares_VSCode_Operations.repo-ops.md`
* `platform-build/Lares_Kernel_Claude.snapshot.md`
* `staging/pre-reorder-2026-04-07/*.snapshot.md`
* archived root `AGENTS` witnesses where they still carry live pressure

This pass only promotes concepts that recur strongly enough to feel load-bearing across the lararium shelf.

<<~/ahu>>

